1
00:00:00,310 --> 00:00:03,040
June, Nankatsu Middle School

2
00:00:00,780 --> 00:00:05,400
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

3
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:08,870
Nankatsu Middle School.

4
00:00:08,870 --> 00:00:11,900
Until recently just an ordinary middle school, Nankatsu...

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:17,320
...is now a place where passionate young footballers gather.

6
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:24,040
Tsubasa, who entered Nankatsu Middle School, quickly became the star of the football club and...

7
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:31,250
...together with his friends from Nankatsu SC, won the National Regional Tournament twice in a row.

8
00:00:31,250 --> 00:00:36,300
Now he enters his final summer of middle school.

9
00:00:37,350 --> 00:00:38,230
Oh no!

10
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:39,720
Idiot! What are you doing?!

11
00:00:39,720 --> 00:00:42,300
Ishizaki-kun, I'm leaving the other side to you!

12
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:45,060
And here I thought it would be fun!

13
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:49,310
Hisami Sugimoto

14
00:00:45,060 --> 00:00:49,310
Tsubasa-senpai, you can't leave all the defense work to Ishizaki-san!

15
00:00:49,310 --> 00:00:50,440
Hey, you there!

16
00:00:50,440 --> 00:00:51,940
I can hear you, first-year baby!

17
00:00:52,850 --> 00:00:54,380
That's not it.

18
00:00:54,380 --> 00:00:55,700
What?

19
00:00:55,700 --> 00:01:00,740
Tsubasa-kun now plays as a midfielder instead of forward.

20
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:01,910
Pardon?

21
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:03,910
Yukari Nishimoto

22
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:04,840
Do you not know anything?

23
00:01:04,840 --> 00:01:07,170
Wait-- Ouch, Yukari-senpai.

24
00:01:07,170 --> 00:01:09,730
Midfielders are the core of the team.

25
00:01:09,730 --> 00:01:12,460
They serve as the team's control tower.

26
00:01:12,460 --> 00:01:17,720
Therefore, they need to be good not only in attack but also in defense.

27
00:01:17,720 --> 00:01:19,550
Although it's a challenging position...

28
00:01:19,550 --> 00:01:23,760
...I think it's the most suitable position for the team captain, Tsubasa-kun.

29
00:01:26,140 --> 00:01:28,420
Tsubasa-senpai, push!

30
00:01:28,190 --> 00:01:30,770
Football Club Coach
Takeshi Furuoya

31
00:01:28,420 --> 00:01:30,770
Come on, come on! Score a goal!

32
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,030
# Nankatsu vs Kida #

33
00:01:39,030 --> 00:01:42,280
Nankatsu Middle School is really strong.

34
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:45,120
But this year, we will represent the Shizuoka Region.

35
00:01:45,120 --> 00:01:50,580
Yes, the four of us will cut off their attacks and launch our own.

36
00:01:50,580 --> 00:01:56,660
And the one who will score our victory goals is you, Nitta.

37
00:01:56,660 --> 00:01:58,460
I know.

38
00:01:58,460 --> 00:02:00,680
I'll score one goal, or even two.

39
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:09,070
After all, I was the one who led Nankatsu SC to the championship in your absence.

40
00:02:12,270 --> 00:02:14,980
Ai! Ai! Ai!

41
00:02:12,270 --> 00:02:14,980
Love! Love! Love!

42
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:18,570
Ai! Ai! Ai!

43
00:02:15,900 --> 00:02:18,570
Love! Love! Love!

44
00:02:19,490 --> 00:02:22,200
Ai! Ai! Ai!

45
00:02:19,490 --> 00:02:22,200
Love! Love! Love!

46
00:02:29,070 --> 00:02:31,920
moeru you ni hitori demo

47
00:02:29,070 --> 00:02:31,920
Even if I burn alone

48
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:38,170
I keep lying to myself that I can live alone

49
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:38,170
I keep running while lying to myself that I can live alone

50
00:02:38,170 --> 00:02:44,050
unobore no morosa wo kimi wa shitteta na no ni

51
00:02:38,170 --> 00:02:44,050
You knew how fragile my arrogance makes me

52
00:02:44,050 --> 00:02:50,640
kokoro made uchinomaresareta kono yoru ni

53
00:02:44,050 --> 00:02:50,640
In this night that even shatters my heart

54
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:54,650
kimi no koe sagasu

55
00:02:50,640 --> 00:02:54,650
Searching for your voice

56
00:02:54,650 --> 00:02:59,150
kono yowasa ga nikui yo

57
00:02:54,650 --> 00:02:59,150
I hate how weak I am

58
00:02:59,150 --> 00:03:04,700
ima sugu torimodoshi ni ikanakya

59
00:02:59,150 --> 00:03:04,700
I have to go get you back right now

60
00:03:04,700 --> 00:03:06,280
baka darou?

61
00:03:04,700 --> 00:03:06,280
Aren't I a fool?

62
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,490
ai

63
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,490
Love!

64
00:03:07,490 --> 00:03:11,120
kizudarake no ai wo shinjite

65
00:03:07,490 --> 00:03:11,120
Believing in my love full of wounds

66
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:20,880
nagareochita namida sae mo tsuyosa e to kaete

67
00:03:11,120 --> 00:03:20,880
I'll turn even the tears I've shed into strength

68
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:21,720
ai

69
00:03:20,880 --> 00:03:21,720
Love!

70
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:25,510
kizudarake no ai da to shite mo

71
00:03:21,720 --> 00:03:25,510
Even if it's a love full of wounds

72
00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:29,520
bokura no sekai wo tomoshiteru

73
00:03:25,510 --> 00:03:29,520
It illuminates our world

74
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:35,770
kono ai mo ichido taritomo

75
00:03:29,520 --> 00:03:35,770
Not even for a moment will this love

76
00:03:35,770 --> 00:03:38,560
hanasanai

77
00:03:35,770 --> 00:03:38,560
I won't let it fade

78
00:03:40,530 --> 00:03:45,530
Episode 29:
The Beginning of Summer!

79
00:03:40,530 --> 00:03:45,530
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

80
00:03:41,020 --> 00:03:45,400
Ozora Tsubasa-kun, that was a wonderful performance as always.

81
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:47,230
Thank you very much.

82
00:03:45,710 --> 00:03:48,240
Even Soccer Eleven came for an interview?

83
00:03:47,230 --> 00:03:48,590
Tell us a bit about the match.

84
00:03:48,240 --> 00:03:51,070
As popular as ever.

85
00:03:48,590 --> 00:03:50,000
Alright.

86
00:03:51,070 --> 00:03:52,670
Exactly.

87
00:03:52,670 --> 00:03:56,250
Even in spring, he was joining high school training sessions.

88
00:03:56,250 --> 00:04:00,050
Over 3 years, he's completely outclassed us.

89
00:04:00,050 --> 00:04:00,960
Yes.

90
00:04:00,960 --> 00:04:02,460
What are you saying?

91
00:04:02,460 --> 00:04:05,470
Isn't football a game of 11 players?

92
00:04:05,470 --> 00:04:08,080
This is the strength of all of you.

93
00:04:08,080 --> 00:04:11,430
Tsubasa hasn't changed at all, but you've changed a lot.

94
00:04:11,520 --> 00:04:15,580
The president of the Nankatsu Cheer Squad...

95
00:04:15,580 --> 00:04:18,210
...has become such a lady.

96
00:04:18,210 --> 00:04:21,280
It's a big shock for those who came from Nankatsu.

97
00:04:21,280 --> 00:04:22,970
Really?!

98
00:04:22,970 --> 00:04:25,080
Sanae-san, you were the cheer squad captain?

99
00:04:25,080 --> 00:04:26,240
I never expected that!

100
00:04:26,240 --> 00:04:28,320
She's a completely different person now.

101
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:31,490
They say love changes a person.

102
00:04:31,490 --> 00:04:33,200
What?! Could it be--

103
00:04:33,980 --> 00:04:35,140
What are you saying?

104
00:04:35,140 --> 00:04:36,210
Stop it.

105
00:04:36,210 --> 00:04:38,470
But it's so obvious!

106
00:04:38,470 --> 00:04:42,210
Because Tsubasa-senpai is so cool!

107
00:04:42,210 --> 00:04:44,540
Peh! Tsubasa this, Tsubasa that!

108
00:04:44,540 --> 00:04:46,630
We're also at Nankatsu Middle School.

109
00:04:47,380 --> 00:04:51,220
I doubt the sanity of anyone who falls for Ishizaki!

110
00:04:51,220 --> 00:04:52,310
What did you say?!

111
00:04:52,310 --> 00:04:53,940
Say that again, I dare you!

112
00:04:53,940 --> 00:04:55,530
What's up?!

113
00:04:57,060 --> 00:05:01,580
The regional qualifiers for the summer tournament are about to start, right?

114
00:05:01,580 --> 00:05:03,140
How do you feel?

115
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:08,070
Yes, we'll do our best as we do every year.

116
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:13,660
All of your opponents aim to break Nankatsu's dominance.

117
00:05:13,660 --> 00:05:18,270
Hyuga Kojiro-kun's former partner from elementary school at Toho Academy...

118
00:05:18,270 --> 00:05:21,540
...Sawada Takeshi-kun will also be participating this year.

119
00:05:21,540 --> 00:05:23,440
Furano Middle School from Hokkaido...

120
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:27,800
...led by their captain Matsuyama-kun, emphasizes teamwork more than ever.

121
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:30,070
Hanawa Middle School with the Tachibana Twins...

122
00:05:30,070 --> 00:05:33,350
...and Musashi Middle School with the Glass Star Player Misugi-kun...

123
00:05:33,350 --> 00:05:37,110
...also want to break Nankatsu Middle School's winning streak this year.

124
00:05:37,110 --> 00:05:38,600
I would want that too.

125
00:05:38,600 --> 00:05:40,860
We're not planning to lose.

126
00:05:40,860 --> 00:05:42,560
Thank you very much.

127
00:05:42,560 --> 00:05:45,150
We expect a good fight in the tournament.

128
00:05:45,150 --> 00:05:46,140
See you.

129
00:05:46,140 --> 00:05:47,720
Thank you very much.

130
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,860
Yes.

131
00:05:50,460 --> 00:05:53,630
Hyuga-kun, Misugi-kun and the others...

132
00:05:53,630 --> 00:05:55,250
They'll all do their best.

133
00:05:57,720 --> 00:06:01,730
But Misaki-kun... I wonder how you are right now?

134
00:06:01,730 --> 00:06:04,750
We haven't been able to see each other for years since that time.

135
00:06:05,490 --> 00:06:08,840
And also Roberto...

136
00:06:13,630 --> 00:06:18,810
After you left, I switched from forward to midfielder as you said.

137
00:06:18,810 --> 00:06:22,270
I followed the instructions in the notebook you left.

138
00:06:22,270 --> 00:06:27,440
I learned new moves and improved my fitness.

139
00:06:27,440 --> 00:06:32,480
Learning and absorbing your techniques...

140
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:34,700
...made me even more passionate about Brazil.

141
00:06:35,430 --> 00:06:40,250
My dream of going to the football country Brazil burns brighter and brighter.

142
00:06:42,250 --> 00:06:48,220
Queria falar mais devagar que disse? Manda vir um taxi.

143
00:06:45,840 --> 00:06:49,130
Tsubasa's Portuguese Teacher
Carlos

144
00:06:48,220 --> 00:06:49,480
Pronto!

145
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:52,340
Tsubasa, your pronunciation is getting better and better.

146
00:06:52,340 --> 00:06:53,700
Really?

147
00:06:54,350 --> 00:06:56,160
Where are you going, Carlos?

148
00:06:56,160 --> 00:06:58,600
A short bathroom break.

149
00:06:58,600 --> 00:07:00,850
Isn't it "retrete"?

150
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:03,650
Carlos.

151
00:07:03,650 --> 00:07:07,320
How is Tsubasa's Portuguese lesson going?

152
00:07:07,320 --> 00:07:11,990
From what I see, he has no trouble speaking.

153
00:07:11,990 --> 00:07:13,720
Very good, very.

154
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:15,260
No need to worry.

155
00:07:15,260 --> 00:07:18,200
But as his family, won't you mind?

156
00:07:18,200 --> 00:07:19,380
What?

157
00:07:19,380 --> 00:07:22,720
Are you really planning to send Tsubasa to Brazil?

158
00:07:22,720 --> 00:07:24,930
He is your only son, after all.

159
00:07:26,160 --> 00:07:28,210
We've already made our decision.

160
00:07:28,210 --> 00:07:33,230
People from the National Football Federation will also help.

161
00:07:33,230 --> 00:07:37,300
We'll probably send him right after he graduates middle school.

162
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:45,860
But before that, we want Tsubasa to spend his last summer in Japan without any regrets.

163
00:07:45,860 --> 00:07:48,230
# Absolute 3rd Tournament Victory! #

164
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,440
They finally announced it.

165
00:07:52,440 --> 00:07:55,740
The regional qualifier matchups.

166
00:07:57,030 --> 00:08:01,160
So because we're seeded, we won't play until the second round.

167
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:03,340
The result will be the same anyway.

168
00:08:03,340 --> 00:08:06,790
There's no team in this region that can beat us!

169
00:08:06,790 --> 00:08:10,630
Sensei, isn't Otomo Middle School in the other bracket?

170
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:13,300
Yes, we can only play them in the final.

171
00:08:13,300 --> 00:08:18,680
Otomo; isn't that the team with Urabe, Kishida, Nakayama, and Nishio?

172
00:08:18,680 --> 00:08:21,640
Rumors say they've gotten quite strong this year.

173
00:08:21,640 --> 00:08:23,780
What are you afraid of?

174
00:08:23,780 --> 00:08:25,630
If you're that worried...

175
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:28,580
...let's have a practice match and show them their place.

176
00:08:28,580 --> 00:08:31,720
They rejected our practice match request.

177
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,490
What?

178
00:08:32,490 --> 00:08:36,030
So they don't want to show their hand to us yet.

179
00:08:36,030 --> 00:08:37,110
Yes.

180
00:08:37,110 --> 00:08:41,550
Even this is enough to show how eager they are to beat Nankatsu.

181
00:08:41,550 --> 00:08:43,670
No matter who our opponent is, we must win.

182
00:08:43,670 --> 00:08:46,310
We'll focus on the regional qualifiers!

183
00:08:46,310 --> 00:08:47,330
Yes!

184
00:08:47,330 --> 00:08:51,250
# Nankatsu Municipality - Nankatsu Middle School #

185
00:08:54,260 --> 00:08:55,400
Alright, let's go!

186
00:08:55,400 --> 00:08:56,830
One more goal!

187
00:08:57,470 --> 00:09:00,640
Aren't those people watching over there Urabe's group?

188
00:09:01,080 --> 00:09:02,790
Yes, Otomo Middle School.

189
00:09:02,790 --> 00:09:04,640
Looks like they came to gather information.

190
00:09:04,640 --> 00:09:06,250
Catch it, Ishizaki.

191
00:09:06,250 --> 00:09:07,440
Not a clearance!

192
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:08,940
The match is over!

193
00:09:12,860 --> 00:09:15,440
Hey! Long time no see, everyone.

194
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:17,440
Throw us the ball, would you?

195
00:09:17,440 --> 00:09:19,440
If you want it, get it yourself.

196
00:09:19,440 --> 00:09:20,950
W-What?!

197
00:09:20,950 --> 00:09:22,780
We're rivals now.

198
00:09:22,780 --> 00:09:24,620
What friendly attitudes these are.

199
00:09:24,620 --> 00:09:25,940
What did you say?!

200
00:09:25,940 --> 00:09:30,450
Don't act so high and mighty when all you do is run away from us in fear!

201
00:09:30,450 --> 00:09:32,500
How dare you come and spout nonsense?!

202
00:09:32,500 --> 00:09:35,330
We're actually not running from you.

203
00:09:35,330 --> 00:09:40,380
It's just that breaking Nankatsu's winning streak in a practice match doesn't seem interesting!

204
00:09:40,380 --> 00:09:43,510
We'd prefer to do it in the regional tournament!

205
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:45,930
Come on.

206
00:09:45,930 --> 00:09:50,530
You two are former teammates.

207
00:09:50,530 --> 00:09:52,440
There's no need to clash like this.

208
00:09:52,440 --> 00:09:55,440
Let's show our strength!

209
00:09:57,240 --> 00:09:59,200
Tsubasa, the ball is coming!

210
00:10:01,490 --> 00:10:03,010
Alright, let's go!

211
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:11,750
These moves...

212
00:10:11,750 --> 00:10:14,300
They're like sharks after their prey!

213
00:10:14,300 --> 00:10:16,050
Who are they?

214
00:10:16,050 --> 00:10:20,840
Even Urabe-kun, Kishida-kun, Nishio-kun, and Nakayama-kun...

215
00:10:20,840 --> 00:10:23,920
Coach, shouldn't you stop them?

216
00:10:25,710 --> 00:10:27,730
Hey, what happened, Tsubasa?

217
00:10:30,550 --> 00:10:32,440
They took the ball from Tsubasa!

218
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,370
Impossible!

219
00:10:33,370 --> 00:10:34,570
Even though it was four against one...

220
00:10:34,570 --> 00:10:35,930
...they took the ball from Tsubasa!

221
00:10:35,930 --> 00:10:36,600
Nitta!

222
00:10:37,280 --> 00:10:38,030
Alright!

223
00:10:39,160 --> 00:10:39,860
Fast.

224
00:10:39,860 --> 00:10:41,530
Crude moves, but...

225
00:10:41,980 --> 00:10:42,780
Morisaki!

226
00:10:45,110 --> 00:10:48,080
Go! Hawk Shot!

227
00:10:54,310 --> 00:10:56,090
What?!

228
00:10:58,580 --> 00:11:02,740
Did you see that, Nankatsu?! This is our power!

229
00:11:02,740 --> 00:11:04,140
What did you say?!

230
00:11:04,140 --> 00:11:06,010
Exactly!

231
00:11:06,010 --> 00:11:10,140
This year, the team that will participate in the national tournament is Otomo Middle School!

232
00:11:14,070 --> 00:11:17,230
Tsubasa, don't look so down.

233
00:11:17,230 --> 00:11:23,100
After all, they are the Nankatsu SC players who became national champions.

234
00:11:23,100 --> 00:11:24,020
Yes.

235
00:11:24,020 --> 00:11:26,740
But they've gotten very strong.

236
00:11:26,740 --> 00:11:30,290
We can't let our guard down even in the qualifiers.

237
00:11:27,520 --> 00:11:31,160
It's obvious their speed isn't what it used to be.

238
00:11:30,290 --> 00:11:33,220
Besides, it's impossible for us to lose.

239
00:11:31,160 --> 00:11:34,500
But that wasn't the only reason they took the ball.

240
00:11:34,970 --> 00:11:36,500
That ball he shot...

241
00:11:36,500 --> 00:11:40,420
When I blocked it, my leg went numb.

242
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:43,760
That hadn't happened since that match.

243
00:11:45,730 --> 00:11:47,800
They called him Nitta, right?

244
00:11:47,800 --> 00:11:49,690
Who exactly is he?

245
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:57,000
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

246
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,530
Nitta Shun.

247
00:11:59,530 --> 00:12:03,700
You could call him the savior of Nankatsu SC.

248
00:12:04,220 --> 00:12:05,450
Savior?

249
00:12:05,450 --> 00:12:06,800
Exactly.

250
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:11,120
Nitta is fast enough to run 100 meters in 11 seconds.

251
00:12:11,120 --> 00:12:13,900
Also, his legs are very flexible.

252
00:12:13,900 --> 00:12:16,860
His special move is a shot called the Hawk Shot...

253
00:12:16,860 --> 00:12:19,110
...and it comes from his flexibility.

254
00:12:19,110 --> 00:12:21,160
It's a very sharp shot.

255
00:12:21,160 --> 00:12:23,220
Yes, I was surprised too.

256
00:12:23,220 --> 00:12:26,800
They also say he plays with a lot of heart.

257
00:12:26,800 --> 00:12:31,710
Even though his upperclassman Sawada Takeshi was at Meiwa FC, he beat them and...

258
00:12:31,710 --> 00:12:37,230
...after you graduated from Nankatsu SC, he led them to the championship.

259
00:12:37,230 --> 00:12:42,250
Frankly, participating in the national tournament won't be so easy this year.

260
00:12:42,250 --> 00:12:43,120
Yes.

261
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:45,610
Umm, are you Ozora Tsubasa-san?

262
00:12:45,610 --> 00:12:47,820
Could you watch our training?

263
00:12:47,820 --> 00:12:51,790
We want to shoot like you too, Tsubasa-san!

264
00:12:51,790 --> 00:12:53,950
Of course, gladly.

265
00:12:53,950 --> 00:12:56,000
Otomo Team! Push!

266
00:12:56,000 --> 00:12:56,480
Yes!

267
00:12:56,480 --> 00:12:56,840
Push!

268
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:57,280
Yes!

269
00:12:57,280 --> 00:12:57,640
Push!

270
00:12:57,640 --> 00:12:58,130
Yes!

271
00:12:58,130 --> 00:12:58,480
Push!

272
00:12:58,480 --> 00:12:59,260
Yes!

273
00:12:59,260 --> 00:13:01,050
Hey Urabe, look at that.

274
00:13:01,050 --> 00:13:01,750
What?

275
00:13:01,750 --> 00:13:02,800
There!

276
00:13:06,390 --> 00:13:08,050
Tsubasa!

277
00:13:08,700 --> 00:13:09,640
Urabe!

278
00:13:09,640 --> 00:13:12,130
With the tournament so close...

279
00:13:12,130 --> 00:13:14,640
...are you sure you have time to play with kids?

280
00:13:14,640 --> 00:13:18,000
Yesterday we showed you how strong we are...

281
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,060
...but I see you're still relaxed!

282
00:13:20,650 --> 00:13:22,060
Just watch, Tsubasa!

283
00:13:22,060 --> 00:13:27,570
In the regional tournament, we'll humble that arrogant nose of yours!

284
00:13:27,570 --> 00:13:29,780
Urabe, watch your words.

285
00:13:29,780 --> 00:13:31,450
Alright, let's go.

286
00:13:31,450 --> 00:13:32,200
Yes!

287
00:13:35,330 --> 00:13:37,920
I can already see the outcome.

288
00:13:37,920 --> 00:13:42,440
But be patient until the finals, Tsubasa-senpai.

289
00:13:44,780 --> 00:13:50,220
For 2 years, they've been running to this field every day.

290
00:13:50,220 --> 00:13:50,890
What?

291
00:13:50,890 --> 00:13:54,390
From here to Otomo Middle School is about 30 kilometers.

292
00:13:54,390 --> 00:13:57,890
It's not a distance you can run comfortably.

293
00:13:57,890 --> 00:14:01,800
Otomo Middle School's defense is the best in the region.

294
00:14:01,800 --> 00:14:04,420
But they had trouble with attack.

295
00:14:04,420 --> 00:14:07,650
However, this year Nitta joining became their trump card.

296
00:14:07,650 --> 00:14:12,830
The missing final piece is now complete.

297
00:14:11,570 --> 00:14:12,830
Otomo Middle School

298
00:14:20,620 --> 00:14:23,170
I'm counting on you tomorrow, buddy.

299
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:29,300
Exactly!

300
00:14:29,300 --> 00:14:31,680
We had let our guard down.

301
00:14:31,680 --> 00:14:35,260
We always thought we would win.

302
00:14:35,260 --> 00:14:37,850
We were too arrogant.

303
00:14:37,850 --> 00:14:43,860
The only way to get rid of this arrogance is nothing but training!

304
00:14:43,860 --> 00:14:47,110
We must become even stronger and regain our confidence!

305
00:14:47,110 --> 00:14:50,860
There's no other way!

306
00:14:56,440 --> 00:14:57,870
Here, a towel.

307
00:14:57,870 --> 00:14:59,370
Manager!

308
00:14:59,370 --> 00:15:01,510
Come on, wipe your sweat.

309
00:15:01,510 --> 00:15:03,540
That way you can push yourself even more.

310
00:15:04,880 --> 00:15:06,380
Alright, let's go!

311
00:15:09,280 --> 00:15:12,300
Now we'll split into teams of 5 and 4 and play a mini match.

312
00:15:12,950 --> 00:15:15,620
Hey Tsubasa. You're overdoing it a bit.

313
00:15:15,620 --> 00:15:18,310
Exactly. Let's rest a bit.

314
00:15:18,310 --> 00:15:20,020
Didn't you hear?

315
00:15:20,020 --> 00:15:21,310
5 and 4 players.

316
00:15:21,750 --> 00:15:28,110
In the regional and national tournaments, we'll have to play under the summer sun.

317
00:15:28,110 --> 00:15:31,050
Winning 3 times in a row like this is impossible.

318
00:15:31,050 --> 00:15:35,620
Okay, but think about the lowerclassmen too.

319
00:15:35,620 --> 00:15:37,620
Come on, everyone! 5 vs 4!

320
00:15:37,620 --> 00:15:39,620
D-Damn, Tsubasa!

321
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:41,120
Stop, both of you!

322
00:15:42,320 --> 00:15:43,560
Coach...

323
00:15:43,560 --> 00:15:48,610
After a 5-minute break, the 3rd years will play against the 1st and 2nd years.

324
00:15:48,610 --> 00:15:51,440
Tsubasa, you play with the 1st and 2nd years.

325
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:52,130
What?!

326
00:15:52,130 --> 00:15:53,680
Is that okay, Tsubasa?

327
00:15:53,680 --> 00:15:55,090
Yes.

328
00:15:56,120 --> 00:15:59,510
Don't you think Tsubasa is taking this a bit too seriously?

329
00:15:59,510 --> 00:16:00,680
Exactly.

330
00:16:00,680 --> 00:16:03,930
We're also trying our best.

331
00:16:03,930 --> 00:16:05,150
Is that so?

332
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:07,540
What do you mean?

333
00:16:07,540 --> 00:16:08,650
Nothing.

334
00:16:08,650 --> 00:16:11,650
It's just that your eyes look different.

335
00:16:13,180 --> 00:16:16,990
Just now, Tsubasa's eyes looked different from all of yours.

336
00:16:16,990 --> 00:16:18,990
Tsubasa-senpai!

337
00:16:21,980 --> 00:16:25,790
- Everyone, stay calm and don't rush.
- Okay!

338
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:25,790
Damn it! What do you mean our eyes look different?!

339
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:29,290
Let's show that we can fight well even without Tsubasa!

340
00:16:29,290 --> 00:16:30,170
Yes!

341
00:16:31,210 --> 00:16:32,840
Here we come, Tsubasa!

342
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,640
Stop them!

343
00:16:33,640 --> 00:16:34,420
Okay!

344
00:16:35,300 --> 00:16:36,220
Don't get cocky!

345
00:16:40,470 --> 00:16:44,520
Izawa, your dribbling is still inadequate!

346
00:16:44,520 --> 00:16:45,440
Here!

347
00:16:46,190 --> 00:16:48,020
O-Okay.

348
00:16:48,020 --> 00:16:49,560
Got it!

349
00:16:49,560 --> 00:16:50,820
Take it, Taki!

350
00:16:51,690 --> 00:16:54,310
Alright, I'll carry it to the line!

351
00:16:54,310 --> 00:16:54,950
Taki!

352
00:16:55,890 --> 00:16:58,030
You rely too much on your special move!

353
00:16:58,740 --> 00:17:00,990
Think of other attack patterns!

354
00:17:00,990 --> 00:17:01,740
Taki!

355
00:17:01,740 --> 00:17:04,160
Kisugi! Look around!

356
00:17:05,560 --> 00:17:07,840
If you get marked this easily, what will you do?

357
00:17:07,840 --> 00:17:12,140
If you're going to be a midfielder, be more mobile and create open space for yourself!

358
00:17:12,140 --> 00:17:13,170
Tsubasa-kun...

359
00:17:14,130 --> 00:17:16,180
Here we come! Follow me!

360
00:17:16,180 --> 00:17:16,930
Yes!

361
00:17:16,930 --> 00:17:18,410
Let's stop him, Takasugi!

362
00:17:18,410 --> 00:17:18,930
Yes!

363
00:17:20,670 --> 00:17:21,310
Da--

364
00:17:23,140 --> 00:17:27,140
Do you guys in defense think this is enough to protect the Nankatsu goal?!

365
00:17:32,730 --> 00:17:34,170
You too, Morisaki!

366
00:17:34,170 --> 00:17:37,870
If it were Wakabayashi, he would have stopped that shot with his chest!

367
00:17:40,760 --> 00:17:42,530
Tsubasa!

368
00:17:50,000 --> 00:17:51,540
Alright, let's do this!

369
00:17:51,540 --> 00:17:52,880
We're starting now!

370
00:17:52,880 --> 00:17:54,440
Bring it on again, Tsubasa!

371
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:57,550
Yeah! You won't be able to take the ball so easily next time!

372
00:17:57,550 --> 00:17:59,280
Next time we'll stop you!

373
00:17:59,280 --> 00:18:00,260
Everyone...

374
00:18:01,260 --> 00:18:03,890
W-What's happening?

375
00:18:03,890 --> 00:18:04,880
Let's do this!

376
00:18:04,880 --> 00:18:05,390
Yes!

377
00:18:05,390 --> 00:18:07,140
Exactly!

378
00:18:07,140 --> 00:18:09,740
After the rain, a rainbow appears.

379
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:10,400
Yes.

380
00:18:10,400 --> 00:18:14,690
Everyone's eyes have started to shine just like Tsubasa-kun's.

381
00:18:14,690 --> 00:18:17,090
After seeing that...

382
00:18:17,090 --> 00:18:20,700
...I can't compete with Sanae-senpai in love.

383
00:18:30,340 --> 00:18:31,630
Are you okay?

384
00:18:31,630 --> 00:18:34,280
You're not just about size after all.

385
00:18:34,280 --> 00:18:37,630
Yeah. Your friend is really good.

386
00:18:37,630 --> 00:18:38,820
Isn't he?

387
00:18:38,820 --> 00:18:43,140
Ichijo was our goalkeeper when I won the championship at Nankatsu.

388
00:18:43,740 --> 00:18:44,890
I see.

389
00:18:44,890 --> 00:18:48,100
You won the championship because he protected the goal while you attacked.

390
00:18:49,140 --> 00:18:50,160
Alright!

391
00:18:50,160 --> 00:18:53,700
With this, Otomo Middle School's football is one step closer to being perfect!

392
00:18:53,700 --> 00:18:56,110
This year we will overthrow Nankatsu!

393
00:18:58,870 --> 00:19:02,260
Today, before the National Middle School Football Tournament...

394
00:19:02,260 --> 00:19:05,740
...is the day the Shizuoka Regional Tournament begins.

395
00:19:05,740 --> 00:19:07,590
It has finally arrived.

396
00:19:07,590 --> 00:19:08,480
Yes.

397
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:11,500
# Wakabayashi Genzo - Email #

398
00:19:12,060 --> 00:19:13,080
Wakabayashi-kun!

399
00:19:14,720 --> 00:19:15,710
Hey, wait up!

400
00:19:15,710 --> 00:19:18,860
Tsubasa and everyone at Nankatsu Middle School.

401
00:19:18,860 --> 00:19:21,720
The qualifiers in Japan should be about to start right now.

402
00:19:21,720 --> 00:19:24,740
Do your best for your 3rd victory in the National Tournament.

403
00:19:24,740 --> 00:19:26,940
I'll be supporting you from Germany.

404
00:19:26,940 --> 00:19:29,440
Former Nankatsu SC goalkeeper,

405
00:19:29,440 --> 00:19:31,230
Wakabayashi Genzo.

406
00:19:31,230 --> 00:19:34,690
Wakabayashi-san still hasn't forgotten us.

407
00:19:36,660 --> 00:19:37,980
Tsubasa!

408
00:19:38,420 --> 00:19:39,790
Katagiri-san!

409
00:19:39,790 --> 00:19:41,150
Long time no see.

410
00:19:41,150 --> 00:19:44,740
Japan Football Federation
Katagiri Munemasa

411
00:19:41,150 --> 00:19:44,740
We haven't seen each other since the high school training in spring, right?

412
00:19:45,940 --> 00:19:50,650
I sent most of your videos to football clubs in Brazil.

413
00:19:50,650 --> 00:19:54,160
As I thought, your talent impressed them a lot.

414
00:19:54,160 --> 00:19:57,720
Then will I be able to go to Brazil right after graduation?

415
00:19:57,720 --> 00:19:58,250
Yes.

416
00:19:58,250 --> 00:20:00,380
But they are professionals.

417
00:20:00,380 --> 00:20:02,170
Unless they see you play directly...

418
00:20:02,170 --> 00:20:04,760
...they might not sign a contract with you right away.

419
00:20:04,760 --> 00:20:05,390
Yes.

420
00:20:05,390 --> 00:20:08,640
For now, focus all your attention on the tournament.

421
00:20:08,640 --> 00:20:10,640
We'll talk about Brazil later.

422
00:20:11,280 --> 00:20:13,640
Definitely win, Tsubasa.

423
00:20:14,720 --> 00:20:17,940
First, you'll become a legend in Japan.

424
00:20:17,940 --> 00:20:19,860
Three consecutive championships...

425
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:24,200
No, if you count elementary school, that makes 4.

426
00:20:23,700 --> 00:20:29,490
# Shizuoka Regional Middle School Tournament Championship #

427
00:20:24,200 --> 00:20:26,700
It's already been 4 years since you came to Nankatsu.

428
00:20:26,700 --> 00:20:29,490
You'll go to Brazil undefeated.

429
00:20:29,490 --> 00:20:32,280
After that, you'll reach the top in Brazil.

430
00:20:32,280 --> 00:20:37,970
As number one there, you'll change Japanese football!

431
00:20:37,970 --> 00:20:42,760
Tsubasa, by leading, you'll change this country's football!

432
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:44,010
Yes!

433
00:20:44,940 --> 00:20:48,010
We'll win three consecutive championships!

434
00:20:48,530 --> 00:20:50,510
We won't lose to anyone!

435
00:20:53,700 --> 00:20:56,320
That's right. Exactly.

436
00:20:58,520 --> 00:21:02,530
This is my last year with Tsubasa-kun.

437
00:21:04,260 --> 00:21:06,530
It's finally starting.

438
00:21:06,530 --> 00:21:09,490
The place where football is blended, the Shizuoka Regional Football Tournament.

439
00:21:09,490 --> 00:21:11,740
The championship pennant has returned.

440
00:21:11,740 --> 00:21:17,000
Last year's champion was Nankatsu Middle School, led by Captain Tsubasa.

441
00:21:17,000 --> 00:21:20,750
Since entering middle school, they haven't seen defeat...

442
00:21:20,750 --> 00:21:23,840
...and have been waving the championship pennant for 2 years.

443
00:21:23,840 --> 00:21:28,640
Ishizaki. This year, we'll take the championship pennant.

444
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:30,790
What are you babbling about?

445
00:21:30,790 --> 00:21:33,970
First make it to the finals, then we'll talk.

446
00:21:33,970 --> 00:21:39,850
We'll reach the finals by scoring more goals than you, too.

447
00:21:39,850 --> 00:21:41,310
Don't be ridiculous!

448
00:21:41,310 --> 00:21:42,940
We won't lose.

449
00:21:42,940 --> 00:21:44,610
Okay, let's make a bet then!

450
00:21:44,610 --> 00:21:47,740
A bet on who scores more goals until the finals!

451
00:21:47,740 --> 00:21:50,950
The loser will do whatever the winner says!

452
00:21:50,950 --> 00:21:52,990
Now you've got my interest!

453
00:21:52,990 --> 00:21:54,740
I'm up for the challenge!

454
00:21:54,740 --> 00:21:55,500
Urabe!

455
00:21:55,500 --> 00:21:56,710
Ishizaki!

456
00:21:57,980 --> 00:22:00,590
Keep winning until the finals.

457
00:22:00,590 --> 00:22:03,440
I will definitely beat you.

458
00:22:04,630 --> 00:22:05,460
What?!

459
00:22:07,900 --> 00:22:10,300
So you're relaxed enough to laugh.

460
00:22:10,900 --> 00:22:16,470
But in the finals, I will definitely see worry and defeat on your face!

461
00:22:16,470 --> 00:22:20,060
Just watch, Ozora Tsubasa!

